  "description": "There’s an old rumor about the Schravant’s mansion. That a dark devil will, one day, come to take away the beautiful master of the house. It seems to be nothing more than fanciful thinking, but how does that explain the change that Mihael brings when he barges into the Schravant brother’s lives? The devil will find what Evan and Victor Schravant desire, even if they desperately try to suppress those urges. They say the world’s a stage—what play will these dark souls enact?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
